1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,240 --> 00:01:59,140
Reporting to Ancestor,

25
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,040
some cultivators in the pavilion are suspected

26
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,640
Yun Meng
Treasure Refining Pavilion

27
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,640
to be Soul Formation.

28
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:06,640
Sun Dian
Owner of the Treasure Refining Pavilion
Middle stage Soul Formation

29
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,720
Soul Formation cultivators ?

30
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,090
Treasure Refining Pavilion

31
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:24,440
This person has 2 peak Nascent Soul guards...

32
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:28,520
He must be Soul Formation, the same level as the City Lord.

33
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,400
Please wait here Senior,

34
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:32,000
the auction will begin shortly.

35
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,080
Who's the one

36
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,840
that dared to block my Divine Sense ?

37
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,800
S...Soul Formation ?

38
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,760
Junior didn't know Senior was here,

39
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,240
I hope you'll forgive me.

40
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,540
Fellow cultivator Qiu,

41
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,920
long time no see.

42
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,280
Wang Lin ?

43
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,040
You ..

44
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,160
are actually Soul Formation ?

45
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:26,280
I see that our auction

46
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,600
has attracted quite a few fellow Soul Formation cultivators.

47
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:32,000
Thank you for coming.

48
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,080
If you guys like anything,

49
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,480
feel free to bid.

50
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,440
If you have artifacts,

51
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:41,000
my Treasure Refining Pavilion can also appraise them.

52
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:42,640
I wish you all

53
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,520
the best of luck.

54
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,000
It's him !

55
00:03:53,480 --> 00:04:07,570
Note: This is a scene that was cut from episode 38. In it, Wang Lin and Qiu Siping meet after his killing spree in the Sea of Devils due to the Restriction Flag's tribulation. Sun Dian takes Wang Lin as disciple and puts a restriction on him. Wang Lin expelled that restriction from his body and escaped.

56
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:55,280
Junior is in a hurry.

57
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:57,320
We hope that Senior

58
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,840
can let us go.

59
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:02,590
You're exactly what I was looking for,

60
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,520
do you want to be my disciple ?

61
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,360
Junior is willing.

62
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,040
Fellow cultivator Sun,

63
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,600
do you remember me ?

64
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:18,560
I was reckless with you in the past,

65
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,480
I hope fellow cultivator Wang can forgive me.

66
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,560
In less than 200 years,

67
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,440
that Core Formation cultivator

68
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,400
has actually reached Soul Formation.

69
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,320
Your cultivation is higher than mine.

70
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,240
I'm the one

71
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:33,440
that needs your teachings.

72
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,320
I wonder what kind of treasure

73
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:39,480
fellow cultivator Wang is here for ?

74
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,800
The grade 6 pill recipe.

75
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,800
If it was anything else,

76
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,240
I would be able to help you.

77
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:51,450
but this rank 6 pill recipe is something someone else asked us to sell.

78
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:54,480
I... really can't help you.

79
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,440
No problem.

80
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,240
If I can't buy it,

81
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,440
I'll just steal it to make a copy.

82
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,640
This guy looks mannered

83
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,280
but he's a killer.

84
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:07,880
What if he really started a fight

85
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,000
in my pavilion...

86
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,000
The next item

87
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,440
is a valuable treasure.

88
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,320
I'm sure

89
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:16,400
everyone here already knows

90
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,840
that it's a pill recipe

91
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,080
for a grade 6 pill.
